'''Läoktü''' (Läoktü Chin), or '''Ekai''' (Ekai Chin), is a [[Kuki-Chin languages|Kuki-Chin language]] of [[Burma]]. It was formerly classified as a dialect of [[Laitu language|Laitu]] due to acquired bilingualism.

